---
description: MCP tool action classification and approval policy
alwaysApply: true
---

Classify external actions by their actual effect and target using
`docs/MCP_WORKFLOW.md`, including CLI writes and browser interactions.
Read before writing; preserve the approved target and scope. High-impact actions
need explicit authority; forbidden actions remain forbidden.

For board writes, retrieve `docs/DOCUMENTATION_POLICY.md`, GitHub Project #4
Mirror, and `docs/SECURITY.md`, Shell Execution. The board mirrors TASKS;
approval covers exact values, not adjacent writes. Do not treat a browser or CLI
capability as authorization.
